g_dense_grad_v2_regbase.h` — 发现 **6 个问题**。\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P0 | 0 | — |\n| P1 | 5 | 3 个 mask 值在循环内未更新的逻辑错误 + 2 个 int64_t 路径下循环步长翻倍的错误 |\n| P2 | 1 | InterleaveIndices 中 sreg 未更新（仅在 totalLoop > 1 时触发，触发条件较高） |\n| P3 | 0 | — |\n\n**总体风险评估：高**。本次变更旨在修复多核场景（PR 标题 \"fix EmbeddingDenseGradV2 multiCore\"），但引入的循环分块逻辑存在两类关键缺陷：\n\n1. **Mask 值错误**（Finding 1–4）：新增的分块循环中，控制有效元素数的 mask 变量（`sregBegin`/`sregEnd`/`sreg`）在循环内从未更新，每轮都使用初始总数作为 mask。其中 InterleaveIndices 的 `mask1` 问题最为严重——即使在单轮场景下也会向错误的目标地址写入多余数据，造成内存越界。\n\n2. **int64_t 路径的步长翻倍**（Finding 5–6）：新代码使用固定 int32_t 粒度的 `perVfProcessNum` 来控制 IDX_T 指针的递增和循环次数。当 `IDX_T = int64_t` 时，该值恰好是正确值（`perVfIndices_`）的两倍，导致源数据被跳读一半、循环次数减半。`IDX_T = int32_t` 时无此问题。\n\n这两类缺陷在常用 core 数较小（< 33）时不一定触发，但在该 PR 针对的多核场景下必然触发，导致数据搬运错误、精度异常或内存越界。建议在合入前务必修复。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 5 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:04+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177820759,"discussion_id":"4350046317e4028186e8bd176c65ee8f90fa1408","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n在 `InterleaveIndices`（行 1157-1161）中，mask1 始终与 mask0 使用相同的 `UpdateMask(totalIndicesNum)`。但旧代码中 mask1（higherMask）使用的是 `UpdateMask(tailNum)`，其中 `tailNum = max(0, totalIndicesNum - perVfIndices_)`。\n\nmask1 控制向 `ubDst + strideNum` 写入 vDstReg1 的元素数。vDstReg1 存放的是 interleave 结果的上半部分，只有当 `totalIndicesNum > perVfProcessNum` 时才有有效数据需要写入该位置。新代码无论 totalIndicesNum 多大都写入 `totalIndicesNum` 个元素，即使 totalIndicesNum 很小也会错误地写入多余数据。\n\n**触发条件**：当 `totalIndicesNum ≤ perVfProcessNum`（常见场景：usedCoreNum ≤ 33 左右），mask1 本该为 0（不写入），但新代码写入 `totalIndicesNum` 个元素到 `ubDst + strideNum`，导致目标缓冲区在 strideNum 偏移处被越界写入，破坏后续数据。\n\n**额外影响**：该问题独立于多轮迭代问题（Finding 3），即使在 `totalLoop = 1` 的单轮场景下也会触发。\n\n**建议**：mask1 应使用每轮 vDstReg1 的实际有效元素数：`remaining_vdstreg1 = max(0, remaining - perVfProcessNum)` 且不超过 `perVfProcessNum`。对于单轮场景（totalLoop=1），mask1 应为 `UpdateMask(max(0, totalIndicesNum - perVfProcessNum))`。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:11+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1164,"end_new_line":1164,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177826594,"body":"在循环内使用UpdateMask，每次会自动更新使用的Mask掩码位置","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:11+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177820760,"discussion_id":"3e59668aae64c226b0618e59ff429412f2834d61","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n在 `GatherIndices` 的 begin 循环（行 1090-1102）中，`sregBegin` 初始化为 `beginNumber` 后从未更新。当 `beginLoop > 1`（即 `indicesNumber >= perVfProcessNum`，约 usedCoreNum ≥ 65）时，所有迭代都使用相同的 mask `UpdateMask(beginNumber)`，而非根据每轮剩余元素数逐次递减。\n\n正确模式应参照同文件中 `GatherScaleFreq`（行 975-991）：先算 `loopCnt = beginNumber / perVfProcessNum` 和 `tail = beginNumber % perVfProcessNum`，`loopCnt` 轮用 ALL mask，尾部用 `UpdateMask(tail)`。\n\n失败模式：多核场景下（usedCoreNum 较大），begin 数据超出单条 VReg 容量时，第二轮及之后的 DataCopyGather/DataCopy 使用的 mask 指示了错误的有效元素数，导致数据搬运错误（部分元素丢失或越界写入），进而产生精度问题或内存越界。\n\n**建议**：参照同文件 `GatherScaleFreq`（行 975-991）的模式重构 begin 循环：先计算 `loopCnt = beginNumber / perVfProcessNum` 和 `tail = beginNumber % perVfProcessNum`；`loopCnt` 轮使用 ALL mask（`pMaskAll`）执行完整块搬运；若 `tail > 0` 再执行一轮尾块，mask 使用 `UpdateMask(tail)`。每轮中源/目标指针正确递增。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:35+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1102,"end_new_line":1102,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177826422,"body":"在循环内使用UpdateMask，每次会自动更新使用的Mask掩码位置","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:35+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177820761,"discussion_id":"8bdb6516201224c1be45aa818c473d416eea555f","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n`GatherIndices` 中新引入的循环控制变量 `perVfProcessNum` 定义为 `GetVRegSize() / sizeof(int32_t)`（始终为 int32_t 粒度），但源代码和目标指针类型为 `IDX_T*`。\n\n当 `IDX_T = int64_t` 时，`perVfProcessNum = 2 * perVfIndices_`。导致以下三个参数全部错误：\n\n1. **beginLoop**（行 1065）：`(beginNumber + perVfProcessNum - 1) / perVfProcessNum` = `ceil(beginNumber / 64)`，但实际每轮只能处理 `perVfIndices_ = 32` 个 int64_t 元素。应使用 `ceil(beginNumber / perVfIndices_)`。\n2. **srcStride**（行 1064）：`perVfProcessNum * interval = 64 * interval`，但每轮 DataCopyGather 只处理 32 个元素。应为 `perVfIndices_ * interval = 32 * interval`。\n3. **endLoop**（行 1066）：同理，`endNumber / 64` 应为 `endNumber / 32`。\n\n组合效果：每轮源指针跳过了应处理的一半元素，同时循环次数是应有的一半，导致数据被部分跳过且处理不全。`IDX_T = int32_t` 时无此问题（`perVfProcessNum == perVfIndices_`）。\n\n**建议**：不应使用固定 int32_t 粒度的 `perVfProcessNum` 控制 int64_t 循环。改用类成员 `perVfIndices_`（基于 `sizeof(IDX_T)`）计算循环次数和步长：`loopCnt = beginNumber / perVfIndices_`，`tail = beginNumber % perVfIndices_`，`srcStride = perVfIndices_ * interval`。这能保证 int32_t 和 int64_t 路径均正确。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1066,"end_new_line":1066,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177826622,"body":"在循环内使用UpdateMask，每次会自动更新使用的Mask掩码位置","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:17:19+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177820762,"discussion_id":"8010da66e2bb0124b4784805e139077a921e3f26","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n与 sregBegin 相同的问题，出现在 `GatherIndices` 的 end 循环（行 1104-1116）。`sregEnd` 初始化为 `endNumber`（=`indicesNumber + 1`）后从未更新。当 `endLoop > 1`（即 `endNumber >= perVfProcessNum`）时，所有迭代都使用同一个 mask，导致第二轮及之后的 DataCopyGather/DataCopy 搬运错误的元素数量。\n\n正确模式应参照同文件中 `GatherScaleFreq`（行 975-991）：先算 `loopCnt = endNumber / perVfProcessNum` 和 `tail = endNumber % perVfProcessNum`，`loopCnt` 轮用 ALL mask，尾部用 `UpdateMask(tail)`。\n\n**建议**：参照同文件 `GatherScaleFreq`（行 975-991）的模式重构 end 循环：先计算 `loopCnt = endNumber / perVfProcessNum` 和 `tail = endNumber % perVfProcessNum`；`loopCnt` 轮使用 ALL mask；若 `tail > 0` 再执行一轮尾块，mask 使用 `UpdateMask(tail)`。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:49+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1116,"end_new_line":1116,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177826475,"body":"在循环内使用UpdateMask，每次会自动更新使用的Mask掩码位置","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:16:49+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177820763,"discussion_id":"e71b1f8187c55ec2e23884d83db35603c978f45c","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n`InterleaveIndices` 中引入的循环控制变量 `perVfProcessNum`（行 1133）定义为 `GetVRegSize() / sizeof(int32_t)`，固定为 int32_t 粒度。当 `IDX_T = int64_t` 时，`perVfProcessNum = 2 * perVfIndices_`，导致以下参数全部错误：\n\n1. **perInterleave**（行 1134）：`perVfProcessNum * DOUBLE = 128`，但每轮 Interleave 实际产生 `2 * perVfIndices_ = 64` 个 int64_t 输出元素。应为 `perVfIndices_ * DOUBLE = 64`。\n2. **totalLoop**（行 1136）：`ceil(totalIndicesNum / 128)`，应为 `ceil(totalIndicesNum / 64)`。循环次数少了一半。\n3. **源指针递增**（行 1165-1166）：每轮 `DataCopy` 读取 `perVfIndices_ = 32` 个 int64_t 元素，但指针递增 `perVfProcessNum = 64`，跳过一半数据。\n4. **目标指针递增**（行 1167）：每轮写入至多 64 个 int64_t 元素，但递增 `perInterleave = 128`，目标缓冲区产生 64 元素空洞。\n\n`IDX_T = int32_t` 时无此问题（`perVfProcessNum == perVfIndices_`）。\n\n**建议**：使用 `perVfIndices_`（`GetVRegSize() / sizeof(IDX_T)`）替代 `perVfProcessNum` 计算 InterleaveIndices 的循环参数：`perInterleave = perVfIndices_ * DOUBLE`，`totalLoop = (totalIndicesNum + perInterleave - 1) / perInterleave`，源指针递增使用 `perVfIndices_`，目标指针递增使用 `perInterleave`。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:25:47+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1136,"end_new_line":1136,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177829256,"body":"对于int64类型，使用了双寄存器，不会产生跳过","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:25:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:25:47+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177820768,"discussion_id":"f3888e6897f3e43142d650c466d6c375aaeeb611","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n在 `InterleaveIndices` 的循环（行 1149-1168）中，`sreg` 初始化为 `totalIndicesNum` 后从未更新。当 `totalLoop > 1`（即 `totalIndicesNum >= 2 * perVfProcessNum`，约 usedCoreNum ≥ 129 在 VRegSize=256 时）时，所有迭代中 mask0 和 mask1 都使用同一个 `sreg` 值，而非根据当轮剩余元素数递减。\n\n正确模式应参照同文件中 `GatherScaleFreq`（行 975-991）：全块迭代使用 ALL mask，尾块使用 `UpdateMask(remaining)`。此处还应区分 mask0（vDstReg0 写入）和 mask1（vDstReg1 写入）各自的剩余元素数。\n\n**建议**：在循环内每轮计算 `remaining = totalIndicesNum - i * perInterleave`，mask0 使用 `min(perVfProcessNum, remaining)`，mask1 使用 `max(0, remaining - perVfProcessNum)` 并限制在 `perVfProcessNum` 以内。","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:57:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:25:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1168,"end_new_line":1168,"start_old_line":1130,"end_old_line":1130,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":177827238,"body":"在循环内使用UpdateMask，每次会自动更新使用的Mask掩码位置","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:19:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:25:50+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"}}]},{"id":177833779,"discussion_id":"1993ad25da6fec172206da201123b07ce6a10419","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s): ci-pipeline-passed.","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:39:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:39:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177834097,"discussion_id":"9fb4beabc0701c2da3d12b5e3c0336aeb24c9314","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s): stat/needs-squash.","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:41:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:41:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=175569